# Routes mail for the reserved 'shared' read-only mailbox pseudo-recipient
# through the custom 'shared' pipe(8) transport (see master.cf, appended in
# Containerfile) instead of the default virtual_transport -- so it's
# delivered by deliver-shared/safecat rather than the virtual(8) agent,
# whose hardcoded mode-0600 maildir files would make it unreadable to
# everyone but the delivery agent itself. Static texthash:, independent of
# bbs.db like the rest of the 'shared' configuration.
shared@bbs.local	shared:
